  <item>
    <title>G15. 这女子棒球赛，就非打不可吗？---曦照赛复盘与展望</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6452a965306513184cf9362b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6452a965306513184cf9362b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 May 2023 18:35:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>4.29-5.1，我们刚刚打完三天的第三届曦照女子棒球赛。这一期是策划总监&amp;橘子队经理马珂、主办人屈直、资深设计涂涂的赛事复盘与瞎扯淡，还有一只话很多的小狗子参与了录音。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 曦照女子棒球赛前情提要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">2:37</a> 左眼是资源，右眼是需求，捏把捏把就成型了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">5:44</a> 最焦虑的是等待球队报名邮件的那些天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">9:13</a> 逼上梁山，大数据请帮我找到全国打棒球的女生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> Midjourney, ChatGPT, 资深设计，策划总监，科技与人才赋能女棒赛事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> Swing for the fences, 她不设限</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 一百万句感谢MLB中国！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 为了省800块安装费，几乎折损一米五的大个儿兄弟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2906">48:26</a> 露营风观众席，球队周边贩卖小摊，极致的观众体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 精彩的比赛，需要为女生量身定制的赛制做保障！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3097">51:37</a> 所谓“菜鸡”组成的散客队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3225">53:45</a> 圈粉无数的黑马球队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">58:05</a> 实至名归的冠军球队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3804">1:03:24</a> 为什么我们只打女子赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4089">1:08:09</a> 全宇宙最棒的颁奖仪式，最棒的女生式鼓励</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4454">1:14:14</a> 路过的人也看到了我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">1:15:50</a> 以后还会有以后吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4605">1:16:45</a> 要让新入坑的菜鸡也有比赛可打！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-iiV1A0Ct0q9BThUKGc1OAn-UB.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>看了都说好的大片海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaPEaqlKIHOPKzpxcF-Ct7cIH-v.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>比赛之后哭了的马珂与快乐的屈直、涂涂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlojDiuh8l1bakLPunEgJYjUh0Oi.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎扫二维码了解一下没有招到赞助商的招商企划</span></p><span></span><p><span>想了解更多赛事资讯或有兴趣一起打女子棒球的朋友欢迎关注小红书“上海橘子女子棒球队”，或加小经理微信“haobaseball”。有合作介绍的也欢迎联系我们。</span></p>]]></description>
