    <guid isPermaLink="false">640a0ce9092eb63cb03c3f46</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Mar 2023 16:44:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>番外篇惊喜更新！</span></p><span></span><p><span>做正片的时间很紧迫，只想着抓紧上线（谁知道到底在急什么？），就冒失删掉了很多内容。事后回味，越想越觉得可惜。今晚看中国对日本的比赛，又想到了当时几个很有趣的内容，还是决定遵从内心的冲动，加紧剪出来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">1:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">3:18</a> 毫无争议的中国男棒最强奥运世代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">3:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">8:12</a> 田忌赛马，巴西输给的是中国千年智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">8:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 利益分配不公，是比赛更是生意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a> 薛定谔的追星，是遗憾还是笑话？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">18:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 看着google地图数球场，也就大陆球迷能干这事儿</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvErFp1XDXlCWU3ZYVXkgA95IBl2.m4a" length="33561530" type="audio/mp4"/>
