  <item>
    <title>G14. 世界棒球经典赛来了！棒球疯子们讲述现场看球经历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64072761aba069c152503c0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64072761aba069c152503c0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Mar 2023 12:00:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2023年3月，将迎来今年第一个棒球盛世——四年一度的WBC世界棒球经典赛，棒球届的“世界杯”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个月前我与星爷吃饭，听他讲了10年前组团去日本看中国队征战WBC的故事，念念不忘，犹豫了俩月，终于还是忍不住请他和当年的伙伴一起录了这期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>星爷：“星爷聊球”棒垒球博主，全网同名</span></p><span></span><p><span>华盛：碳水棒球队主理人，“碳水一刻”电台主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>李骁潇（Ace）：“野球观察”微博博主，棒球从业者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">2:26</a> 大佬云集的棒球茶话会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">2:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">3:42</a> 被踢出奥运会后的棒球“拯救”计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">3:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 为平衡实力而制定的特殊规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a> 对标世界杯，MLB不甘心于“美国”职棒大联盟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">7:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 运气与实力并存，中国棒球竟然这么牛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="646">10:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 人人网、百度贴吧、qq群，我们是这样成团的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 摇中国队旗、敲中国大鼓的日本狂热中国队球迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 虐心一路，终于见证惊天大逆转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 2023，中国队能赢由业余球员组成的捷克队吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> Call Back，嘉宾韩啸也是本届WBC的中国队选手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1393">23:13</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 国内看棒球指南，9月杭州亚运会中国女垒，重要的事情说三遍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3qDM6VpVKWc4Tgp0jPkMJ14z7A.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>外野看台的日本球迷，右边画圈的是他们从中国大使馆借的中国大鼓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnmx_UM78_yEhPTI460DoqJLZVQY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2013年逆转巴西获胜后，喜极而泣的中国球迷。左一是华盛，右一是星爷</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>勘误：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1 美国职业棒球现在下有5个小联盟，不是6个。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2 2023年是第5届世界WBC，不是第6届。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3 在東海大菅生打过球的是梁培，不是陆昀。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llrl5jW3zsmPwiNq25CXQ59c_Qvb.m4a" length="39109235" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrdERudGdMaGQ5ZzFGckFrT2FkdXFsbjgzMjYucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>G13. 在NCAA打垒球是怎样的体验？(下)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6268f7b8eabd9b6af9c311d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6268f7b8eabd9b6af9c311d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Apr 2022 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>焦晨曦，曾经是NCAA D1特拉华大学主力投手、北京垒球队投手、台师大垒球队投手，现任北大垒球队教练。本期节目，由焦指导细致的为大家介绍在NCAA打垒球是怎样的体验，让我们随着她激情澎湃的故事，一起体验风光也风雨的十年垒球生涯~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">0:54</a> 全方位、沉浸式体验NCAA大学垒球生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a>后学生时代，继续索寻垒球生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 双重身份，职场白领+北京垒球队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a> 新赛道开启，在台湾高校打垒球是怎样的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 找不回的巅峰状态，需要一位心灵捕手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 比起球技，中国高校的垒球教练更多的是“心理工作”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> 业余棒垒，刺激的比赛哪里找？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 快节奏低容错率高戏剧性，垒球比起棒球，能有多精彩？</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：焦晨曦</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：9carat</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ls1NvOBUOSd-YdG7-atvg6-2wq0o.m4a" length="60343508" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z0V2ZIcVFEV1BlU0FWLTZ1SmhzUGF0Xzc2eTUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>G12. 在NCAA打垒球是怎样的体验？（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/626033ab493ea2f504a55d5a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">626033ab493ea2f504a55d5a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Apr 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>焦晨曦，曾经是NCAA D1特拉华大学主力投手、北京垒球队投手、台师大垒球队投手，现任北大垒球队教练。本期节目，由焦指导细致的为大家介绍在NCAA打垒球是怎样的体验，让我们随着她激情澎湃的故事，一起体验风光也风雨的十年垒球生涯~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">1:09</a> 比起游泳，打垒球，跟玩儿似的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">8:05</a> 草率的决定，美国俱乐部垒球就像学而思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 很傻很天真，NCAA D1根本可望不可即</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 以退为进，社区大学+NJCAA联盟生涯开启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 惨遭释出，携手好友一起开启新地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2603">43:23</a> 王牌投手，振臂高挥！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3925">1:05:25</a> 两度夺冠也不是终点，挑战NCAA D1奖学金Offer</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnfyJaybL4xrmOpJBkLHQZk_P2kr.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>焦晨曦代表特拉华大学投球</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：焦晨曦</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：9carat</span></p>]]></description>
