  <item>
    <title>G11. 在甲子园打棒球是怎样的体验？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6242fe671f48506a4b01749e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6242fe671f48506a4b01749e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Mar 2022 12:41:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不得了了！我们请到了一位重磅嘉宾！韩啸，日本甲子园高中野球球员，现在是中国国家队队员！正值春季甲子园期间，就请韩啸给大家讲讲在甲子园打棒球是怎样的体验啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a> 重磅嘉宾介绍！韩啸，从日本甲子园到中国国家队主力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">1:21</a> 十岁小学生，棒球命运自己主宰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">4:09</a>光速打脸，棒球不是好玩的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">6:03</a> 漫画情节开启，赴日挑战甲子园！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">7:57</a> 沉浸式体验甲子园棒球少年的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 残酷竞争，替补球员全力以赴的青春</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a> 止步地区赛四强，球场饱含了多少少年的眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 一往无前虎山行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 粉丝要找的是红色手套的少年！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 后高中时代，开启职业棒球生涯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnEQ4MLGqjItq1bkxAf11Nmb2nVW.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>微博网友为韩啸自制海报</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FgFJVsS2LQ_AR1bfgIDWkNLhmIBM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>日本报社对韩啸的报道</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fg80Df8K7e1ag6M0AjpRjSQOCr5B.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>职业运动员期间的韩啸</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：韩啸</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：Xbus99</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：9carat</span></p>]]></description>
