  <item>
    <title>G8. 棒球少女眼中的《雄狮少年》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61e6438157c5d9822fe69e7b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61e6438157c5d9822fe69e7b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Jan 2022 04:35:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>棒球少女看《雄狮少年》，很难不共情到自己打棒球时克服种种艰难、终于从菜鸟成长为老菜鸟的经历。和阿娟一样，我们也是被生活和工作所困的社畜，舞狮/棒球是我们心中的火与光。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">2:54</a> 粉丝点播，橘子队日常大放送</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">5:41</a> 开播第一次，嘉宾泪洒录音棚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">8:37</a> 社畜已经很辛苦了，还要再给自己加个活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 终于开始聊电影！人生多的是无奈和失败，守护心中那团火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 羡慕当年啥也不懂的我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 拼尽全力练打击，佩服如此努力的我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 感谢棒球，我的心门给同事圈开了一条缝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> 震惊！垒球冠军成为家居设计师，工作是陪老板打乒乓球？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 将爱好变为职业才算为了理想“献出心脏”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 谁还要打棒球到八十岁？</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：柏杨</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：柏杨</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小金、阿方、9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：9carat</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：9carat</span></p>]]></description>
