    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宇宙大碰撞来了！这是一期运动女生“化妆派”vs“素颜派”关于打球化妆的正式交流！</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>柏杨，同济女垒创始人，橘子队编外人员</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><p><span>黄雯，上海SSG女子棒球队三垒手，元老级球员</span></p><p><span>徐杰，上海橘子队队员</span></p><p><span>马珂，上海橘子队队员</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">0:39</a> 嘉宾和主题介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">2:30</a> 美少女棒球手的干货分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">6:44</a> 你眼中的我vs我眼中的我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 化好妆去打球！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 不化妆就算了，防晒总要的吧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a> 差等生的化妆补习班</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 甲子园棒球少年vs美式棒球少女</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 全副武“妆”！气势十足！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> 素颜的我如何靠近全妆的你</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 运动女性谈容貌焦虑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2283">38:03</a> 我的榜样是球场上的“女装大佬”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">46:38</a> 少年气女生的心路历程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3186">53:06</a> 公共浴室的观察与沉思</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> 美是一种实验精神</span></p><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmLSFym7Sf3nw-cFfIIXuKA17nd9.jpeg"></figure><p><span>本期合影</span></p><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FpHtiloBG9rXfaTVKxVKUsK_OFbO.jpeg"></figure><p><span>黄雯帮柏杨化妆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FiRezn6J3wxUqFZfWXrWteXXhYSc.jpeg"></figure><p><span>全妆的美少年与全妆的.....嗯</span></p><p><span>策划：柏杨</span></p><p><span>音频制作：9carat</span></p><p><span>文案：9carat</span></p>]]></description>
