    <guid isPermaLink="false">6190faa903abe84b7f8b8f89</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Nov 2021 12:01:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！ 本期节目初次尝试聊了点棒球以外的运动——女子拳击。为了给大家最真实的分享，几位嘉宾经历了两次疯狂的拳击暴汗体验！除开会跟大家分享拳击体验以外，也延伸出关于棒球、大小众运动、女性榜样等话题的讨论。本期节目氛围比较轻松，并且叽叽喳喳、充满了哈哈哈哈... 希望能够给大家带来些欢乐、共鸣及思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：Xbus99</span></p><span></span><p><span>橘子队队员，拳击练习2年，戏精能打也爱和平；</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>9carat：橘子队创始人，拳击0基础，体验所有运动，唯棒球矢志不渝；</span></p><span></span><p><span>大方：橘子队队员，拳击0基础，小狗儿喜欢的运动都喜欢；</span></p><span></span><p><span>小航：橘子队队员，些许拳击练习经历，疯狂想“打人”的捕手；</span></p><span></span><p><span>小金：橘子队队员，拳击0基础，跑不过海啸的女人不哭哭。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">0:42</a>嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">2:02</a>豁！上来就打假拳？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">5:16</a>棒球以外，最吸引人的项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">9:24</a>跑不过海啸的女人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">10:42</a>竟有人自称上辈子是条小狗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="705">11:45</a>打拳女生为什么那么少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a>全世界的体育都是男女失衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a>搏击操和拳击的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a>女子拳馆吸引你的点是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>女性榜样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a>棒球真是项包容的运动啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a>拳击与棒球的相互迁移</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a>公开想打人可还行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a>拳台上必须极致发挥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a>阿方不想认领打拳的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a>拳击是个好的宣泄口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a>哭哭大概是排解情绪的万能公式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a>嗯嗯！方豹子打拳太入戏有羞耻感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a>运动到底有什么的吸引力？——给懒癌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a>经历竞技运动后，爱得更深！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a>方小狗探索边界、专注自我的成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a>其实你身体也需要表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a>坚持打完拳之后身体、精神的满足感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a>有人喜欢压迫感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a>运动带来应变能力的提升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a>运动 vs 打游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a>小心骨质疏松</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a>躲不过的运动损伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2861">47:41</a>不要设限！运动游戏我都要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>踢足球vs打游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a>大众vs小众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a>规则复杂vs规则简单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">50:43</a>为什么选择棒垒球？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a>希望棒垒球成为大众运动吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3138">52:18</a>结语</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FrMujNaX3SwYwFWkRZ37YrlAylxY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnB04nTs0jmfCzbvrra253aIEKPu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>第一次体验拳击</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/ltl27vn7euqlv1Kn341ueEofLqtS.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>第二次体验拳击，并且上了擂台练习</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/lp-H52DZ2cWMJLMoC5MLK4ul7N74.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>普琳女子拳馆一年一度的比赛 ——“Sunday Punch”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FiD1prs8jCJZ3KVbNHwnQecD0q81.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/lvuNz0KU94ZFyVEOv1QH-GmBzQSG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>普琳拳馆的部分教练和学员</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/ltJ62W0zPemB_ASllcUI92JLf4te.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上海市业余联赛现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Xbus99</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：9carat、阿方、小金、小航</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：Xbus99</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：Xbus99</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnlsNkuv7awSLK1TbF-x07TMqoE_.m4a" length="77276464" type="audio/mp4"/>
