  <item>
    <title>G3. 英美澳棒垒球体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/617e63e4c890259cb983e2d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">617e63e4c890259cb983e2d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Oct 2021 09:37:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>棒球、垒球在国内毫无疑问是小众的运动，但在海外又是怎样的光景？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们挑选了英美澳这三个留学热门目的地，并邀请了三位嘉宾来与我们一起聊聊他们在海外打球的第一手体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡麻：曾经的英国留学生，在英国棒垒球届反复横跳的女人。现在北京鶸队活动</span></p><span></span><p><span>渣渣：现居澳洲，深度参与澳洲女子棒球生态，现属于墨尔本大学女子棒球队</span></p><span></span><p><span>小胖：曾经的美国留学生，挑战美利坚棒球界的勇者。现在北京庭院棒球队和北京鶸队活动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00:00</a>开场及嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">0:04:15</a>英国，棒垒球的荒漠，菜鸟的乐园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">0:06:09</a>为了打棒球竟然“投敌”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">0:10:43</a>国外的棒球是男女混打吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">0:11:59</a>在英国打快投垒球能有多快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">0:15:58</a>在澳洲还有更快乐的女子棒球呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">0:16:29</a>OMG我的队友竟然是澳洲棒球名人堂选手！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">0:22:40</a>封城两年治郁我，我选择棒球治愈我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">0:23:43</a>胆敢挑战美利坚的男人：蛮坎坷的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">0:25:31</a>不是NCAA，是NCBA！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">0:26:54</a>我的队友曾被MLB选秀选中！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">0:28:18</a>高度竞争的环境下，队友是竞争对手吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">0:30:44</a>什么？女生在美国没有棒球可打？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1903">0:31:43</a>女性平权诉求促进NCAA女垒的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">0:32:37</a>体育课是澳洲人民最爱上的课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">0:34:12</a>免费打球？不存在的！啥啥都花钱，没钱？可以分期付款！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">0:45:34</a>路径依赖，打球是我融入当地生活的独门秘籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3199">0:53:19</a>活明白了，输赢不是比赛的全部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3337">0:55:37</a>球痴，不分国籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3416">0:56:56</a>“If you build it, they will come.”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3534">0:58:54</a>西学东鉴，痱子粉滑垒法你学会了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3588">0:59:48</a>干货时间：怎样在国外找到球队打球？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FoCaynXx-6YAwAeLJcLGepHlqWS6.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>伦敦北部的Finsbury Park，拥有伦敦市区最好的棒球设施，是UCL棒球队的训练地</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FvezBZc2qcsu_6PPekcq-mUvp09u.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>英国大学棒球联赛冠军奖杯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FiOXhCT9KxPZV2Ti3xsBgsD48kHz.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>渣渣：working on a baseball ass at the Greater Melbourne Women’s Open Friendship Baseball Tournament</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FsstP6eyTdHlLO--O3wFR2S8cEJk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2014年，ASU Club Baseball Team合影</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：9carat、阿方</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：胡麻、渣渣、小胖</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频制作：胡麻</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：胡麻</span></p>]]></description>
